s" /></entry><entry><title>US announces South Africa visa curbs over race claims</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:09068876616509182ab82b3806269cd854fffad7482632c4d7a33ea0c27bb7a4</id><updated>2026-09-16T19:36:45Z</updated><published>2026-09-16T10:23:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/us-announces-south-africa-visa-curbs-over-race-claims/a-79288287--ba8545978a2c.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/us-announces-south-africa-visa-curbs-over-race-claims/a-79288287?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The visa restriction policy targets South African nationals who US Secretary of State Marco Rubio claims are responsible for "race-based discrimination" against white citizens.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Global Gender Gap Report: Women's hard-won gains 'fragile'</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:7ba3625f8204882bdf5c2f7cd6ca6853a3163f94bf41a8f4d62de06a1646ab0a</id><updated>2026-09-16T19:36:45Z</updated><published>2026-09-16T10:05:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/global-gender-gap-report-women-s-hard-won-gains-fragile/a-79280086--9ed95bd98a77.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/global-gender-gap-report-women-s-hard-won-gains-fragile/a-79280086?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Two decades of progress toward gender parity is at risk as women's political representation declines, according to a new World Economic Forum report. At the current pace, the remaining gap could take 120 years to close.</summary><category term="Business" /></entry></feed>
